       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ARITHMETIC-TEST.
       
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUM1 PIC 9(5) VALUE 100.
       01 WS-NUM2 PIC 9(5) VALUE 50.
       01 WS-SUM PIC 9(5).
       01 WS-DIFF PIC 9(5).
       01 WS-PROD PIC 9(7).
       01 WS-QUOT PIC 9(5).
       
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-NUM1 + WS-NUM2.
           COMPUTE WS-DIFF = WS-NUM1 - WS-NUM2.
           COMPUTE WS-PROD = WS-NUM1 * WS-NUM2.
           COMPUTE WS-QUOT = WS-NUM1 / WS-NUM2.
           
           DISPLAY "SUM: " WS-SUM.
           DISPLAY "DIFFERENCE: " WS-DIFF.
           DISPLAY "PRODUCT: " WS-PROD.
           DISPLAY "QUOTIENT: " WS-QUOT.
           
           STOP RUN.
